        "reply_draft": "Hi Raj,\n\nThanks for getting in touch. To get 8 pumps to Govan, we need to dispatch stock from our Central Scotland hub, as our Glasgow branch only holds 1 pump in stock. Our stock comprises 6 petrol trash pumps (£420.00 each) and electric submersible pumps (£180.00 each, requiring a 110V power supply).\n\nBecause of delivery cut-offs and stock locations, we cannot meet all three requirements (8 pumps, 08:00 delivery, and under £100 delivery fee) under a single standard order. A colleague will call you shortly to discuss which of the following options works best for you:\n\n1. Express overnight delivery by 07:30 tomorrow: 6 petrol trash pumps + 2 electric submersible pumps. Delivery charge is £150.00 (Total: £3,030.00).\n2. Standard delivery by 13:00 tomorrow: 6 petrol trash pumps + 2 electric submersible pumps. Delivery charge is £50.00 (Total: £2,930.00).\n3. Glasgow branch morning delivery by 07:30 tomorrow: 1 electric submersible pump. Delivery charge is £25.00 (Total: £205.00).\n\nKind regards,\nTravis Perkins Glasgow"
